{"seq":91,"slug":"game-networking-replication","title":"游戏网络同步与状态复制","stage":"DONE","category":"game-development","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-networking-replication","rating":{"composite":4.18,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4.2,"coverage":3.75,"positioning":4.5,"strategic":4.33},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"游戏网络同步与状态复制\">游戏网络同步与状态复制</h1><p>游戏网络同步是多人游戏开发中最具挑战性的工程领域之一。每一帧，成千上万个游戏实体的状态需要在毫秒级的时间窗口内跨越不可靠的网络完成同步——延迟、抖动、丢包是无法消除的物理约束，而玩家的感知却要求&quot;所见即真实&quot;。理解权威服务器架构、延迟补偿、状态预测与回滚等核心技术，是构建流畅多人游戏体验的基础。</p>\n<p>本 hub 面向已掌握基础网络编程（TCP/UDP、Socket API）的中级游戏开发者，聚焦于游戏同步与状态复制的核心算法与工程实践。不讨论传输层协议细节（见 <code>05_game-networking</code>），也不涉及包级自定义协议设计（见 <code>16_multiplayer-netcode</code>），以及回放与录像确定性（见 <code>38_game-replay-determinism</code>）。</p>\n<p><strong>第1章《网络基础与同步模型》</strong> 建立同步系统的理论基础：C/S 权威模型与 P2P 中继对比、RTT 测量与 Tick Rate 设计、状态序列化与 Bitpacking 压缩，是全局理解的起点。</p>\n<p><strong>第2章《客户端预测与服务端调和》</strong> 深入预测-确认循环：输入预测与死区推算让玩家即时响应，服务端调和处理状态分叉，快照缓冲与插值/外推让过去的状态流畅呈现。</p>\n<p><strong>第3章《回滚、增量复制与兴趣裁剪》</strong> 覆盖高级复制技术：GGPO 式回滚网络代码重构格斗游戏的同步方式，增量 XOR diff 与游程编码压缩带宽，AOI 兴趣管理与优先级队列裁剪无关实体。</p>\n<p><strong>第4章《确定性、命中判定与反作弊》</strong> 面向特殊场景的深度话题：定点数确定性锁步同步 RTS 游戏、服务端回滚命中判定验证射击游戏、输入校验与速度黑客检测守护服务器权威。</p>\n<p>推荐按章节顺序阅读。第1章是所有后续章节的前置。第2章与第3章可并行阅读，前者聚焦实时预测，后者聚焦批量复制。第4章各文档相对独立，按项目类型选读。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"fundamentals","title":"第1章：网络基础与同步模型","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-networking-replication/fundamentals","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"network-model-authority","title":"网络模型与权威服务器","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-networking-replication/fundamentals/network-model-authority"},{"seq":2,"slug":"rtt-jitter-tickrate","title":"RTT 测量与 Tick Rate 设计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-networking-replication/fundamentals/rtt-jitter-tickrate"},{"seq":3,"slug":"state-serialization","title":"状态序列化与 Bitpacking","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-networking-replication/fundamentals/state-serialization"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"prediction","title":"第2章：客户端预测与服务端调和","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-networking-replication/prediction","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"client-prediction","title":"客户端预测与死区推算","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-networking-replication/prediction/client-prediction"},{"seq":2,"slug":"server-reconciliation","title":"服务端调和机制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-networking-replication/prediction/server-reconciliation"},{"seq":3,"slug":"snapshot-interpolation","title":"快照插值与外推","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-networking-replication/prediction/snapshot-interpolation"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"replication","title":"第3章：回滚、增量复制与兴趣裁剪","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-networking-replication/replication","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"rollback-netcode","title":"回滚网络代码与 GGPO","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-networking-replication/replication/rollback-netcode"},{"seq":2,"slug":"delta-compression","title":"增量压缩与 Delta 状态","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-networking-replication/replication/delta-compression"},{"seq":3,"slug":"interest-management","title":"兴趣管理与 AOI 裁剪","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-networking-replication/replication/interest-management"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"advanced","title":"第4章：确定性、命中判定与反作弊","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-networking-replication/advanced","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"deterministic-lockstep","title":"确定性锁步同步","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-networking-replication/advanced/deterministic-lockstep"},{"seq":2,"slug":"server-side-rewind","title":"服务端回滚命中判定","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-networking-replication/advanced/server-side-rewind"},{"seq":3,"slug":"anti-cheat-network","title":"反作弊网络策略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-networking-replication/advanced/anti-cheat-network"}]}]}